.stage-dots i { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .14); }
.stage-dots i.on { background: var(--el); box-shadow: 0 0 4px var(--el); }

/* ═══ DETAIL MODAL ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.detail-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.08fr; }
.detail-art-panel {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 480px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  padding: 36px 22px 28px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 75% 65% at 50% 42%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 24%, transparent), transparent 68%),
    linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(17, 42, 49, .8), rgba(6, 17, 24, .6));
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.detail-art-panel::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  width: 290px; height: 290px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 24%, transparent);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 7%, transparent), 0 0 0 40px color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 4%, transparent);
  top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -52%);
}
.detail-stage-label {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20px; left: 20px;
  font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .14em;
  color: var(--el, var(--mint));
  padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 12%, transparent);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 25%, transparent);
}
.detail-art-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 270px; height: 270px; filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, .45)); animation: showcaseFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
.detail-art-inner .monster-art { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.detail-power-badge {
  position: relative; z-index: 2;
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 7px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(4, 14, 19, .7);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 202, 106, .22);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}
.detail-power-badge span { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .14em; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted-2); text-transform: uppercase; }
.detail-power-badge b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 26px; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1; }
.detail-element-mark { position: absolute; right: -18px; bottom: -18px; width: 150px; height: 150px; color: var(--el); opacity: .12; }
.detail-element-mark svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.detail-body { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px); }
.detail-topline { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.detail-name { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 43px); font-weight: 800; line-height: .92; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.detail-lore { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 9px; }
.detail-level-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 15px; }
.level-ring {
  width: 54px; height: 54px; flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  background: conic-gradient(var(--mint) calc(var(--xp, 0) * 1%), rgba(255, 255, 255, .07) 0);
  position: relative;
}
.level-ring::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0c2029; }
.level-ring b { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; }
.level-ring small { position: absolute; z-index: 1; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--muted); bottom: 12px; }
.level-info { flex: 1; }
.level-info .li-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 5px; }
.level-info .li-top b { color: var(--cream); }
.detail-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 9px 14px; margin-top: 16px; }
.dstat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.dstat .ds-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted-2); letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.dstat .ds-top b { color: var(--cream); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0; }
.dstat .ds-bar { height: 5px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .3); overflow: hidden; }
.dstat .ds-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--el, #75f2bb), color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 45%, #fff)); box-shadow: 0 0 7px color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 40%, transparent); }
.ability-card {
  margin-top: 16px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 7%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .025));
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 20%, transparent);
}
.ability-card .ac-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
.ability-card .ac-icon { width: 26px; height: 26px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 8px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--el); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 13%, transparent); }
.ability-card .ac-icon .element-glyph { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
.ability-card b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; }
.ability-card .ac-cd { margin-left: auto; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted); }
.ability-card p { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 5px; }
.evo-line { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 3px; margin-top: 16px; padding: 9px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .18); }
.evo-node { width: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2px; opacity: .38; }
.evo-node.current { opacity: 1; }
.evo-node.owned { opacity: .8; }
.evo-node .en-art { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .03); }
.evo-node .en-art .monster-art { width: 46px; height: 46px; }
.evo-node span { font-size: 7px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; max-width: 52px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.evo-node.current span { color: var(--mint); }
.evo-sep { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line-strong), transparent); min-width: 8px; }
.detail-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.detail-actions .btn { flex: 1 1 auto; }
.detail-actions .btn-icon-only { flex: 0 0 46px; padding: 0; }
.detail-actions .btn-icon-only svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }

/* ═══ MERGE LAB ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.merge-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.04fr .96fr; gap: 14px; align-items: start; }
.merge-lab { position: relative; padding: clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 30px); min-height: 468px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.merge-lab::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  width: 380px; height: 380px;
  left: 50%; top: 46%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 13%, transparent), transparent 65%);
  filter: blur(10px);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.merge-machine {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: clamp(4px, 1.2vw, 14px);
  margin: 8px 0 20px;
  padding: 8px 0;
  min-height: 206px;
}
.merge-slot {
  position: relative;
  width: clamp(92px, 12vw, 130px);
  height: clamp(112px, 15vw, 158px);
  border-radius: 22px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end;
  padding: 5px 5px 8px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 24%, transparent);
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 65% at 50% 25%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--el, #75f2bb) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%),
    rgba(255, 255, 255, .025);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .05);
}
.merge-slot .monster-art { width: 90%; height: 88%; position: absolute; top: -4%; left: 5%; }
.ms-count {
  position: absolute; right: 7px; top: 7px;
  padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--el); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .4);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 30%, transparent);
}
.ms-label { position: relative; z-index: 2; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--muted-2); text-transform: uppercase; }
.merge-slot.result {
  border-color: rgba(255, 202, 106, .42);
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 35%, rgba(255, 202, 106, .18), transparent 70%),
    rgba(255, 202, 106, .035);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255, 202, 106, .045), 0 0 28px rgba(255, 202, 106, .1), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .07);
}
.merge-slot.result .ms-count { color: var(--gold); border-color: rgba(255, 202, 106, .35); }
.merge-slot.result .ms-label { color: var(--gold); }
.merge-slot .empty-q { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 46px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .14); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -60%); }
.merge-plus { width: 26px; height: 26px; flex: 0 0 auto; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .12); color: var(--muted); }
.merge-plus svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }
.merge-arrow { width: 30px; flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--gold); display: grid; place-items: center; position: relative; }
.merge-arrow svg { width: 30px; height: 22px; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 9px rgba(255, 202, 106, .5)); animation: arrowPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes arrowPulse { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-2px); opacity: .7; } 50% { transform: translateX(2px); opacity: 1; } }
.merge-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 18px; min-height: 48px; }
.merge-copy .mc-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; }
.merge-copy .mc-title em { font-style: normal; color: var(--gold); }
.merge-copy .mc-detail { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; }
.merge-actions { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: auto; }
.merge-actions .btn-primary { flex: 1.5; }
.merge-actions .btn-ghost { flex: 1; }
.merge-hint { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted-2); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 11px; }
.merge-side { padding: 18px; max-height: 560px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.merge-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 2px; }
.merge-row {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  padding: 8px 11px 8px 7px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  text-align: left;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .025);
  transition: .18s;
  width: 100%;
}
.merge-row:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .05); border-color: var(--line); }
.merge-row.active {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 40%, transparent);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 8%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .02));
  box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--el);
}
.mr-art { width: 48px; height: 48px; flex: 0 0 auto; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 15%, transparent), transparent 70%); }
.mr-art .monster-art { width: 54px; height: 54px; }
.mr-info { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.mr-info b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; }
.mr-info span { display: block; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.mr-info span em { font-style: normal; color: var(--el); }
.mr-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; }
.mr-right .mr-count { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--el); }
.mr-right svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; color: var(--muted-2); }
.merge-lab.merging .merge-machine { animation: mergeShake .45s ease-in-out; }
.merge-lab.merging .merge-slot.source { animation: sourceGlow .9s ease both; }
.merge-lab.merging .merge-slot.result { animation: resultGlow .9s ease both; }
.merge-lab.revealing .merge-slot.result .monster-art { animation: resultPop .8s var(--ease-pop) both; }
.merge-flash {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 4;
  border-radius: inherit;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 72% 48%, rgba(255, 245, 196, .85), rgba(255, 202, 106, .25) 30%, transparent 65%);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.merge-lab.merging .merge-flash { animation: mergeFlash .9s ease-out both; }
@keyframes mergeShake { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); } 20% { transform: translateX(-4px) rotate(-.5deg); } 40% { transform: translateX(5px) rotate(.5deg); } 60% { transform: translateX(-3px); } 80% { transform: translateX(2px); } }
@keyframes sourceGlow { 0% { filter: brightness(1); } 35% { filter: brightness(1.7) saturate(1.3); transform: scale(1.04); } 100% { filter: brightness(1); transform: scale(1); } }
@keyframes resultGlow { 0% { filter: brightness(1); } 35% { filter: brightness(1.6); transform: scale(1.06); } 100% { filter: brightness(1); transform: scale(1); } }
@keyframes mergeFlash { 0% { opacity: 0; } 30% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes resultPop { 0% { transform: scale(.4) rotate(-8deg); opacity: 0; } 55% { transform: scale(1.12) rotate(2deg); opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: scale(1); } }

/* ═══ CAMPAIGN ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.campaign-hero {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  gap: 20px;
  padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px);
  border-radius: 28px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(117, 242, 187, .16);
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 100% at 90% 50%, rgba(255, 159, 67, .12), transparent 65%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 100% at 5% 0%, rgba(42, 217, 176, .12), transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(21, 48, 57, .95), rgba(8, 23, 31, .98));
  overflow: hidden;
}
.campaign-hero.boss { border-color: rgba(255, 102, 137, .25); background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 100% at 90% 50%, rgba(255, 102, 137, .14), transparent 65%), radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 100% at 5% 0%, rgba(197, 139, 255, .12), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(42, 31, 54, .95), rgba(11, 18, 29, .98)); }
.campaign-hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; right: -60px; top: -80px; width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .06); box-shadow: 0 0 0 50px rgba(255, 255, 255, .02), 0 0 0 110px rgba(255, 255, 255, .015); }
.ch-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; }
.ch-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(30px, 3.8vw, 44px); font-weight: 800; line-height: .94; margin-top: 6px; }
.ch-title em { font-style: normal; color: var(--gold); }
.ch-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 7px; max-width: 430px; }
.ch-meta { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 12px; }
.ch-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.ch-side { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; min-width: 190px; }
.ch-enemies { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 2px; }
.ch-enemy { width: 76px; height: 82px; position: relative; display: grid; place-items: end center; }
.ch-enemy .monster-art { width: 82px; height: 82px; margin-bottom: -8px; filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4)); }
.ch-enemy.boss { width: 92px; height: 100px; }
.ch-enemy.boss .monster-art { width: 108px; height: 108px; }
.ch-enemy .boss-crown { position: absolute; top: -6px; right: 2px; font-size: 15px; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(255, 202, 106, .7)); }
.ch-side .ch-rec { text-align: right; }
.ch-side .ch-rec span { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted-2); }
.ch-side .ch-rec b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1; }
.ch-side .ch-rec small { font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; }

.campaign-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 14px; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(10, 24, 32, .72); }
.ct-squad { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
.ct-squad .mini-mon { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(117, 242, 187, .12), transparent); display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.ct-squad .mini-mon .monster-art { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
.ct-power { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted); margin-left: 4px; }
.ct-power b { color: var(--mint); }
.stage-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
.stage-card {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  padding: 12px 13px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(20, 40, 49, .8), rgba(8, 21, 29, .92));
  text-align: left;
  transition: .2s;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.stage-card:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: rgba(117, 242, 187, .3); }
.stage-card.current { border-color: rgba(255, 202, 106, .4); background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(52, 45, 30, .8), rgba(11, 23, 28, .94)); box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(255, 202, 106, .08); }
.stage-card.locked { opacity: .46; filter: grayscale(.6); }
.stage-card.cleared { border-color: rgba(117, 242, 187, .18); }
.stage-num {
  width: 46px; height: 46px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--muted);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .07);
}
.stage-card.current .stage-num { color: #3a2204; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #ffe9a8, #ffc357); border-color: #ffe9a8; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255, 184, 77, .25); }
.stage-card.cleared .stage-num { color: var(--mint); background: rgba(117, 242, 187, .09); border-color: rgba(117, 242, 187, .18); }
.stage-num small { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .08em; display: block; line-height: .8; opacity: .7; }
.stage-main { min-width: 0; }
.stage-main h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
.stage-main h3 .boss-tag { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .1em; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 99px; color: #ffb3c4; background: rgba(255, 102, 137, .13); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 102, 137, .22); }
.stage-enemies { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1px; margin-top: 2px; height: 24px; }
.stage-enemies .se-mini { width: 25px; height: 25px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.stage-enemies .se-mini .monster-art { width: 27px; height: 27px; }
.stage-main .stage-sub { font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.stage-side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px; }
.stage-status { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .1em; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted-2); text-transform: uppercase; }
.stage-card.current .stage-status { color: var(--gold); }
.stage-card.cleared .stage-status { color: var(--mint); }
.stage-reward { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); }
.stage-reward .coin-icon { width: 10px; height: 10px; }
.stage-reward .gem-icon { width: 8px; height: 9px; }

/* Team editor */
.team-edit-slots { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.te-slot { position: relative; padding: 8px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .02); text-align: center; min-height: 112px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.te-slot.filled { border-style: solid; border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 32%, transparent); background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--el) 12%, transparent), transparent 70%); }
.te-slot .te-art { width: 66px; height: 66px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.te-slot .te-art .monster-art { width: 72px; height: 72px; }
.te-slot b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; }
.te-slot span { font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; }
.te-slot .te-empty { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted-2); font-weight: 800; }
.te-slot .te-remove { position: absolute; top: 5px; right: 5px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); color: var(--muted); }
.te-slot .te-remove svg { width: 10px; height: 10px; }
.te-pool { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; max-height: 320px; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 2px; }
.te-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 9px 7px 5px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .025); text-align: left; transition: .15s; }
.te-card:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .05); }
.te-card.selected { border-color: rgba(117, 242, 187, .35); background: rgba(117, 242, 187, .06); }
.te-card .tc-art { width: 38px; height: 38px; flex: 0 0 auto; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.te-card .tc-art .monster-art { width: 42px; height: 42px; }
.te-card .tc-copy { min-width: 0; }
.te-card b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.te-card span { font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; }
.te-card .tc-check { margin-left: auto; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); display: grid; place-items: center; color: transparent; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.te-card.selected .tc-check { background: var(--mint); border-color: var(--mint); color: #06251e; }
.te-card .tc-check svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; }

/* ═══ NEST ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.nest-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 34px); border-radius: 28px; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 100% at 15% 50%, rgba(255, 202, 106, .14), transparent 65%), radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 100% at 100% 0%, rgba(197, 139, 255, .1), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(28, 45, 52, .96), rgba(9, 22, 30, .98)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 202, 106, .16); }
.nest-egg-wrap { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; height: 170px; }
.nest-egg-wrap .egg-art { width: 124px; height: 156px; filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4)); animation: eggFloat 4.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
.nest-egg-wrap::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 202, 106, .22), transparent 65%); filter: blur(10px); }
.nest-copy h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px); line-height: .95; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 7px; }
.nest-copy h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--gold); }
.nest-copy p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 560px; }
.nest-chances { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; }
.egg-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-top: 14px; }
.egg-card { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 20px 16px 16px; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--egg) 22%, transparent); background: radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 55% at 50% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--egg) 14%, transparent), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(21, 41, 49, .9), rgba(8, 20, 28, .97)); overflow: hidden; }
.egg-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 160px; height: 160px; top: -60px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--egg) 25%, transparent), transparent 65%); filter: blur(8px); }
.egg-card .egg-card-art { width: 100px; height: 122px; position: relative; z-index: 1; animation: eggFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite; filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35)); }
.egg-card .egg-card-art .egg-art { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.egg-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 9px; }
.egg-card p { font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; min-height: 42px; margin: 4px 0 10px; }
.egg-odds { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
.egg-odds span { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 900; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 99px; color: var(--egg); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--egg) 10%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--egg) 20%, transparent); }
.egg-card .btn { margin-top: auto; width: 100%; }
@keyframes eggFloat { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-1.5deg); } 50% { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(1.5deg); } }

/* ═══ REWARD / SUMMON MODALS ══════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.reward-card { position: relative; width: min(94vw, 560px); max-height: 90dvh; overflow: auto; padding: 30px 26px 24px; border-radius: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 202, 106, .25); background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(255, 202, 106, .16), transparent 65%), linear-gradient(165deg, #132932, #081820 60%, #07131b); box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, .65), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); text-align: center; animation: modalIn .4s var(--ease-pop) both; }
.reward-rays { position: absolute; inset: -50%; background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg, rgba(255, 213, 120, .06) 8deg, transparent 16deg, transparent 30deg, rgba(117, 242, 187, .05) 38deg, transparent 46deg); animation: slowSpin 40s linear infinite; pointer-events: none; }
.reward-kicker { position: relative; display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .3em; font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; }
.reward-title { position: relative; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 54px); line-height: .9; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 5px; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fff6d1, #ffca6a 50%, #ff9f4a); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 20px rgba(255, 184, 77, .25)); }
.reward-sub { position: relative; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 7px; }
.reward-stars { position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--gold); font-size: 24px; }
.reward-stars .star { animation: starPop .5s var(--ease-pop) both; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255, 202, 106, .6)); }
@keyframes starPop { from { transform: scale(0) rotate(-40deg); opacity: 0; } }
.reward-grid { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; text-align: left; }
.reward-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .035); border: 1px solid var(--line); animation: rewardIn .45s var(--ease-pop) both; }
.reward-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .07s; }
.reward-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .14s; }
.reward-item:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .21s; }
@keyframes rewardIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px) scale(.96); } }
.reward-item .ri-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 10px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(255, 202, 106, .08); }
.reward-item .ri-icon .coin-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
.reward-item .ri-icon .gem-icon { width: 16px; height: 18px; }
.reward-item .ri-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--gold); }
.reward-item .ri-copy span { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-weight: 900; color: var(--muted-2); text-transform: uppercase; }
.reward-item .ri-copy b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.1; }
.reward-egg { position: relative; margin-top: 16px; padding: 14px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 202, 106, .3); background: rgba(255, 202, 106, .04); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; text-align: left; animation: rewardIn .5s .25s var(--ease-pop) both; }
.reward-egg .re-art { width: 62px; height: 62px; flex: 0 0 auto; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 14px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 202, 106, .15), transparent 70%); }
.reward-egg .re-art .monster-art { width: 70px; height: 70px; }
.reward-egg .re-copy span { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
.reward-egg .re-copy b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.05; }
.reward-egg .re-copy small { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.reward-actions { position: relative; display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; }
.reward-actions .btn { flex: 1; }
.levelup-note { position: relative; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--mint); }
.reward-close { position: absolute; top: 14px; right: 14px; z-index: 3; }

.summon-card { position: relative; width: min(94vw, 470px); padding: 30px 24px 22px; border-radius: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 202, 106, .22); background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 50% 15%, rgba(255, 202, 106, .16), transparent 65%), linear-gradient(165deg, #142a33, #081820 65%); box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, .65); text-align: center; overflow: hidden; animation: modalIn .4s var(--ease-pop) both; }
.summon-stage { position: relative; height: 230px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.summon-egg { width: 130px; height: 164px; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4)); transition: opacity .3s; animation: summonWiggle 2.2s ease-in-out infinite; }
.summon-egg .egg-art { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.summon-card.cracking .summon-egg { animation: summonCrack .5s ease-in-out 3; }
.summon-card.revealed .summon-egg { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; position: absolute; }
.summon-reveal { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
.summon-card.revealed .summon-reveal { opacity: 1; }
.summon-reveal .sr-inner { width: 190px; height: 190px; position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.summon-reveal .sr-inner::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--el, #75f2bb) 0%, transparent 65%); opacity: .3; filter: blur(14px); }
.summon-reveal .sr-inner .monster-art { width: 190px; height: 190px; position: relative; z-index: 1; animation: resultPop .7s var(--ease-pop) both; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4)); }
.summon-title { position: relative; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 800; }
.summon-sub { position: relative; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; min-height: 17px; }
.summon-rarity { position: relative; display: inline-flex; gap: 5px; align-items: center; margin-top: 7px; }
.summon-card .btn { position: relative; margin-top: 16px; width: 100%; }
@keyframes summonWiggle { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-2deg) translateY(0); } 50% { transform: rotate(2deg) translateY(-6px); } }
@keyframes summonCrack { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0) scale(1); } 25% { transform: rotate(-7deg) scale(1.03); } 75% { transform: rotate(7deg) scale(1.03); } }

/* ═══ HOW TO PLAY ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.howto { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.how-step { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 15px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .025); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.hs-num { width: 30px; height: 30px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 9px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #06251e; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #c3ffe4, #55e7bf); }
.how-step.b gold .hs-num { color: #3b2103; background: linear-gradient(150deg, #fff0b5, #ffca6a); }
.how-step h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; }
.how-step p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 2px; }
.rules-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 7px; margin-top: 4px; }
.rule-pill { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .025); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.rule-pill .element-glyph { width: 12px; height: 12px; }
.settings-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
.setting-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .025); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.setting-row .sr-copy b { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; }
.setting-row .sr-copy span { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
.toggle { width: 44px; height: 25px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1); position: relative; transition: .2s; flex: 0 0 auto; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); }
.toggle::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 19px; height: 19px; border-radius: 50%; background: #cfdcd9; top: 2px; left: 2px; transition: .2s var(--ease-pop); }
.toggle.on { background: rgba(56, 217, 176, .3); border-color: rgba(117, 242, 187, .3); }
.toggle.on::after { left: 21px; background: #75f2bb; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(117, 242, 187, .5); }

/* ═══ BATTLE ARENA ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.battle-screen {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 120;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--sky-1, #0b3b3c);
  overflow: hidden;
  animation: battleIn .5s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .3, 1) both;
  --sky-1: #0b3b3c;
  --sky-2: #155e4e;
  --sky-3: #2f8f5b;
  --hill-1: #1d6b46;
  --hill-2: #14503a;
  --arena-glow: #7ce495;
  --ground: #1d6b46;
}
@keyframes battleIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.03); } }
.battle-screen.theme-glade { --sky-1: #072a2c; --sky-2: #115647; --sky-3: #26825a; --hill-1: #1d6b46; --hill-2: #124b35; --arena-glow: #7ce495; --ground: #1d6b46; }
.battle-screen.theme-brook { --sky-1: #061f38; --sky-2: #0d4e6b; --sky-3: #168aa0; --hill-1: #16606e; --hill-2: #0f4552; --arena-glow: #6ee7ff; --ground: #16606e; }
.battle-screen.theme-ridge { --sky-1: #10102c; --sky-2: #302457; --hill-1: #39406b; --hill-2: #262b52; --arena-glow: #ffd93d; --ground: #39406b; --sky-3: #5f4380; }
.battle-screen.theme-ash { --sky-1: #240d13; --sky-2: #531b1c; --sky-3: #8c3a22; --hill-1: #56241d; --hill-2: #3a1715; --arena-glow: #ff8a4a; --ground: #56241d; }
.battle-screen.theme-ruins { --sky-1: #0e0922; --sky-2: #27174f; --sky-3: #4c2b7a; --hill-1: #2b1f4a; --hill-2: #1c1434; --arena-glow: #c084fc; --ground: #2b1f4a; }
.battle-screen.theme-peak { --sky-1: #071426; --sky-2: #242253; --sky-3: #64386b; --hill-1: #3a3558; --hill-2: #292544; --arena-glow: #a5f3fc; --ground: #3a3558; }
.battle-screen.theme-eclipse { --sky-1: #050209; --sky-2: #170828; --sky-3: #3b1257; --hill-1: #1c1033; --hill-2: #110920; --arena-glow: #c084fc; --ground: #1c1033; }

.arena-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
.arena-bg::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 55% at 50% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 16%, transparent), transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--sky-1) 0%, var(--sky-2) 55%, var(--sky-3) 100%);
}
.arena-bg::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(1.4px 1.4px at 12% 18%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5) 50%, transparent 51%),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 28% 32%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .35) 50%, transparent 51%),
    radial-gradient(1.6px 1.6px at 61% 12%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .45) 50%, transparent 51%),
    radial-gradient(1px 1px at 82% 26%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .4) 50%, transparent 51%),
    radial-gradient(1.2px 1.2px at 44% 8%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .3) 50%, transparent 51%);
  opacity: .6;
}
.arena-sun {
  position: absolute;
  width: min(40vw, 330px); height: min(40vw, 330px);
  left: 50%; top: 6%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 24%, transparent), transparent 64%);
  filter: blur(10px);
  animation: sunPulse 7s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes sunPulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: .55; transform: translateX(-50%) scale(.95); } 50% { opacity: .9; transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.06); } }
.arena-orb {
  position: absolute;
  width: 5px; height: 5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--arena-glow);
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 60%, transparent);
  opacity: .7;
  animation: arenaMote var(--dur, 12s) linear infinite;
  left: var(--l, 20%); bottom: -10px;
  animation-delay: var(--d, 0s);
}
@keyframes arenaMote { to { transform: translateY(-105vh) translateX(20px); opacity: 0; } }
.arena-hill {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--hill-1), var(--hill-2));
  filter: blur(.4px);
  opacity: .9;
}
.hill-back { width: 70%; height: 32%; left: -8%; bottom: 0; opacity: .6; }
.hill-mid { width: 76%; height: 27%; right: -10%; bottom: 0; opacity: .8; }
.hill-front { width: 130%; height: 17%; left: -15%; bottom: -5%; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--ground), color-mix(in srgb, var(--ground) 40%, #000)); border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0; opacity: 1; }
.arena-platform {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 16%;
  width: 55%; height: 16%;
  left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 15%, transparent), transparent 68%);
  border-radius: 50%;
  filter: blur(14px);
}

.battle-topbar {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  height: 58px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 0 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(4, 13, 18, .72), rgba(4, 13, 18, .25));
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}
.b-exit {
  width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  color: var(--cream);
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .25);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .14);
}
.b-exit svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
.b-stage-info { min-width: 0; }
.b-stage-info span { display: block; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .18em; font-weight: 900; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 80%, #fff); text-transform: uppercase; }
.b-stage-info b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.b-round { margin-left: auto; text-align: center; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .28); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .1); }
.b-round span { display: block; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .16em; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .55); font-weight: 900; }
.b-round b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1; }
.battle-auto {
  padding: 6px 11px; border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .12em;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .6);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .14);
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .22);
}
.battle-auto.on { color: #05261e; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #c3ffe4, #75f2bb); border-color: #c3ffe4; }

.battle-field {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  min-height: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 4px 8px 0;
}
.battle-row { position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; gap: clamp(2px, 2.4vw, 34px); z-index: 2; }
.enemy-row { padding-top: 6px; align-items: flex-start; }
.player-row { padding-bottom: 2px; }
.battle-unit {
  position: relative;
  width: min(30%, 190px);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  transition: opacity .4s, transform .3s;
}
.unit-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(4, 13, 18, .5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); max-width: 100%; }
.unit-name { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.unit-lv { font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold); flex: 0 0 auto; }
.battle-unit.enemy .unit-meta { background: rgba(38, 7, 15, .45); border-color: rgba(255, 102, 137, .18); }
.battle-unit.enemy .unit-lv { color: #ffb3c4; }
.unit-visual {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: clamp(74px, 13.5vh, 148px);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  margin: 2px 0 1px;
}
.unit-art {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  width: 100%; height: 100%;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .38));
  transition: filter .25s, transform .25s;
}
.unit-art .monster-art { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.unit-ground {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 2px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 72%; height: 12px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(0, 0, 0, .48), transparent 70%);
  filter: blur(3px);
}
.unit-ring {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -2px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 66%; height: 18px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: .3s;
}
.battle-unit.is-active .unit-ring { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 70%, #fff); box-shadow: 0 0 16px color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 45%, transparent), inset 0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 20%, transparent); animation: ringPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
.battle-unit.is-active .unit-art { filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .38)) drop-shadow(0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 40%, transparent)); }
@keyframes ringPulse { 50% { transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.06); opacity: .7; } }
.battle-unit.is-active::before {
  content: '▼';
  position: absolute;
  top: -9px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-size: 9px;
  color: var(--arena-glow);
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px var(--arena-glow));
  animation: bobbing 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes bobbing { 50% { transform: translate(-50%, 3px); } }

.unit-hp { width: 94%; margin-top: 2px; position: relative; }
.hp-track {
  position: relative;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .48);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hp-track i {
  display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #45e09f, #a9ffd8);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(69, 224, 159, .4);
  transition: width .5s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .3, 1), background .3s;
}
.battle-unit.enemy .hp-track i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff5d82, #ff9db3); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 93, 130, .4); }
.hp-track i.warn { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffb84d, #ffe29a); }
.hp-track i.low { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff4d6d, #ff91a9); }
.hp-text { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 6.5px; font-weight: 900; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, .7); letter-spacing: .03em; }
.unit-statuses { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: calc(100% + 1px); transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; gap: 2px; z-index: 4; }
.status-chip { width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 8px; background: rgba(4, 13, 18, .85); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .2); box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, .4); }
.status-chip.burn { border-color: rgba(255, 138, 74, .5); color: #ffb07a; }
.status-chip.poison { border-color: rgba(139, 226, 111, .5); color: #b6f591; }
.status-chip.stun { border-color: rgba(255, 217, 61, .55); color: #ffe066; }
.status-chip.atkdown { border-color: rgba(197, 139, 255, .5); color: #d8b4fe; }
.status-chip.spdup { border-color: rgba(110, 231, 255, .5); color: #9beeff; }
.status-chip.curse { border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, .5); color: #d8b4fe; }
.shield-bubble {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 4% 12%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid rgba(110, 231, 255, .5);
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 30%, rgba(165, 243, 252, .16), rgba(110, 231, 255, .03) 60%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(110, 231, 255, .22), inset 0 0 18px rgba(110, 231, 255, .12);
  z-index: 3;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: scale(.9);
  transition: .3s;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.battle-unit.has-shield .shield-bubble { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }

.battle-unit.targetable .unit-visual { cursor: crosshair; }
.battle-unit.targetable .unit-visual::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 5% 12%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1.5px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, .3);
  animation: targetSpin 8s linear infinite;
  opacity: .55;
}
.battle-unit.targetable:hover .unit-visual::after { border-color: #ffd166; opacity: 1; }
.battle-unit.targeted .unit-visual::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: -2% 7%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 102, 137, .8);
  box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 102, 137, .4), inset 0 0 18px rgba(255, 102, 137, .15);
  animation: targetPulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;
  z-index: 4;
}
.battle-unit.targeted .unit-meta { border-color: rgba(255, 102, 137, .5); background: rgba(90, 12, 30, .65); }
@keyframes targetSpin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
@keyframes targetPulse { 50% { transform: scale(1.04); opacity: .7; } }

.battle-unit.ko { opacity: .22; filter: grayscale(1); transform: translateY(8px); }
.battle-unit.ko .unit-art { animation: koFade .5s ease both; }
@keyframes koFade { 0% { transform: scale(1) rotate(0); opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: scale(.82) rotate(8deg) translateY(6px); opacity: .3; } }
.battle-unit.attack-up .unit-art { animation: lungeUp .42s ease-in-out; }
.battle-unit.attack-down .unit-art { animation: lungeDown .42s ease-in-out; }
@keyframes lungeUp { 30% { transform: translateY(-22px) scale(1.07); filter: brightness(1.3) drop-shadow(0 0 16px var(--arena-glow)); } }
@keyframes lungeDown { 30% { transform: translateY(22px) scale(1.07); filter: brightness(1.3) drop-shadow(0 0 16px #ff6689); } }
.battle-unit.hit .unit-art { animation: hitShake .4s ease; }
.battle-unit.hit .unit-visual::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 10%; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, .25), transparent 65%); animation: hitFlash .4s ease both; }
@keyframes hitShake { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); } 20% { transform: translateX(-8px) rotate(-2deg); filter: brightness(2); } 40% { transform: translateX(7px) rotate(2deg); } 60% { transform: translateX(-4px); } 80% { transform: translateX(2px); } }
@keyframes hitFlash { 0% { opacity: 0; } 25% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0; } }
.battle-unit.heal .unit-art { animation: healGlow .6s ease; }
@keyframes healGlow { 50% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 18px #75f2bb) brightness(1.2); transform: scale(1.05); } }
.battle-unit.stunned .unit-art { animation: stunWobble .6s ease infinite; }
@keyframes stunWobble { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0); } 25% { transform: rotate(-2deg); } 75% { transform: rotate(2deg); } }
.battle-unit.spawn-in .unit-art { animation: unitSpawn .5s var(--ease-pop) both; }
@keyframes unitSpawn { from { transform: scale(.4) translateY(18px); opacity: 0; } }

.dmg-layer { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 8; }
.dmg-float {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%; top: 22%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(20px, 3.4vh, 32px);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #fff;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .35), 0 0 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
  animation: dmgFloat 1s ease-out both;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.dmg-float.crit { color: #ffd166; font-size: clamp(24px, 4.2vh, 40px); text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #7a3b00, 0 0 20px rgba(255, 209, 102, .6); }
.dmg-float.heal { color: #75f2bb; text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #064a36, 0 0 14px rgba(117, 242, 187, .6); }
.dmg-float.shield { color: #8fe8ff; font-size: clamp(14px, 2.2vh, 20px); }
.dmg-float.miss { color: #cfd8dc; font-size: clamp(14px, 2.2vh, 20px); }
.dmg-float.status { color: #ffb07a; font-size: clamp(13px, 2vh, 18px); }
@keyframes dmgFloat { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, 10px) scale(.6); } 18% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0) scale(1.15); } 35% { transform: translate(-50%, -6px) scale(1); } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -54px) scale(.95); } }

.battle-center {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 3;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 2px 10px;
  min-height: 54px;
}
.turn-label { font-size: 7px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .22em; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .45); text-transform: uppercase; }
.turn-queue { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: -3px; height: 34px; }
.turn-portrait {
  width: 28px; height: 28px;
  margin-left: -6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  background: rgba(4, 13, 18, .65);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .14);
  position: relative;
  transition: .25s;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.turn-portrait:first-child { margin-left: 0; }
.turn-portrait .monster-art { width: 34px; height: 34px; }
.turn-portrait.current { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-color: var(--arena-glow); box-shadow: 0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--arena-glow) 40%, transparent); z-index: 2; transform: translateY(-2px); }
.turn-portrait.enemy { border-color: rgba(255, 102, 137, .3); }
.turn-portrait.enemy.current { border-color: #ff6689; box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 102, 137, .4); }
.turn-portrait.dead { opacity: .2; filter: grayscale(1); }
.battle-message {
  min-height: 20px;
  padding: 3px 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(4, 13, 18, .55);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .8);
  text-align: center;
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  max-width: 92vw;
}
.battle-message b { color: var(--arena-glow); }
.battle-message.enemy b { color: #ff91a9; }
.battle-start-banner {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 20;
  left: 50%; top: 46%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(34px, 8vw, 72px);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  color: #fff;
  text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--arena-glow), 0 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .35);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.battle-start-banner.show { animation: bannerIn 1.3s ease both; }
@keyframes bannerIn { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(.7); } 20% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.05); } 70% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -55%) scale(1.04); } }

.battle-actions {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 12;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 9px 12px calc(10px + var(--safe-b));
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5, 15, 21, .35), rgba(4, 13, 18, .92) 30%);
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .09);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
}
.action-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
.action-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 7px; min-height: 16px; }
.action-hint { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .55); }
.action-hint b { color: var(--arena-glow); }
.action-hint.enemy { color: #ffb3c4; }
.action-hint.enemy b { color: #ff91a9; }
.action-cd-note { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .4); }
.action-buttons { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1.1fr .8fr; gap: 8px; }
.action-btn {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  min-height: 58px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .13);
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(32, 54, 64, .9), rgba(12, 27, 35, .95));
  text-align: left;
  transition: .16s var(--ease-pop);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.action-btn::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 100% at 0% 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .08), transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
.action-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .26); }
.action-btn:active:not(:disabled) { transform: scale(.97); }
.action-btn:disabled { opacity: .38; }
.action-btn .ab-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 10px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); }
.action-btn .ab-icon svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
.action-btn .ab-icon .element-glyph { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
.action-btn .ab-copy { min-width: 0; }
.action-btn .ab-title { display: block; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.05; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.action-btn .ab-sub { display: block; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .5); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-top: 1px; }
.action-btn.attack .ab-icon { color: #ffd166; background: rgba(255, 209, 102, .1); border-color: rgba(255, 209, 102, .18); }
.action-btn.ability .ab-icon { color: var(--ability-color, #c58bff); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ability-color, #c58bff) 12%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ability-color, #c58bff) 22%, transparent); }
.action-btn.guard .ab-icon { color: #8fe8ff; background: rgba(143, 232, 255, .08); border-color: rgba(143, 232, 255, .16); }
.action-btn.ability.ready { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ability-color, #c58bff) 45%, transparent); box-shadow: 0 0 18px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ability-color, #c58bff) 12%, transparent), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .1); }
.action-btn .cd-badge { position: absolute; top: 5px; right: 6px; font-size: 7px; font-weight: 900; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .5); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .65); }
.action-btn .ab-cost { margin-left: auto; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 900; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .45); }
.battle-tip { margin-top: 5px; text-align: center; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .3); }
.battle-tip b { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .5); }

/* Battle intro */
.battle-intro { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 30; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(2, 8, 12, .72); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); animation: fadeIn .3s both; }
.battle-intro-card { text-align: center; padding: 24px; animation: modalIn .5s var(--ease-pop) both; }
.battle-intro-card .bi-kicker { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .28em; font-weight: 900; color: var(--arena-glow); text-transform: uppercase; }
.battle-intro-card h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 64px); line-height: .9; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 6px; text-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5); }
.battle-intro-card p { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .65); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8px; }
.battle-intro-card .bi-vs { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }
.battle-intro-card .bi-vs .monster-art { width: 90px; height: 90px; }
.battle-intro-card .bi-vs span { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; color: var(--gold); }
.battle-intro-card .bi-rec { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

/* Result banners */
.battle-result-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 25; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(2, 8, 12, .68); backdrop-filter: blur(7px); animation: fadeIn .3s both; padding: 16px; }
.result-burst { position: absolute; width: 420px; height: 420px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 202, 106, .2), transparent 65%); animation: auraPulse 4s infinite; }
.result-card { position: relative; text-align: center; padding: 30px; }
.result-card .rc-kicker { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .3em; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); }
.result-card .rc-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(48px, 11vw, 86px); line-height: .85; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 5px; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fff5c9, #ffca6a 45%, #ff8a4a); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 30px rgba(255, 184, 77, .35)); }
.result-card.defeat .rc-title { background: linear-gradient(120deg, #ffd0dc, #ff6689 50%, #8b2d48); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
.result-card p { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .65); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8px; }

/* Battle stats modal (log) */
.battle-log { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; max-height: 300px; overflow: auto; }
.log-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .025); }
.log-row b { color: var(--cream); }

content.text:
Now responsive.css. Need breakpoints and battle-specific mobile adjustments, safe area. Ensure mobile 390x844 fits. Bottom nav heights. Topbar.

Breakpoints:
- max-width 1120: hide main nav, show bottom nav; view-root padding bottom; topbar.
- max-width 980: home grid 1 col, merge layout 1 col, monster grid 3, home hero 2 cols? could keep.
- max-width 760: hero one col, detail one col, campaign hero one col, stage grid one col? Could keep 2 at tablet. Monster grid 2. Home stats 2. egg grid 1 or 2? 1 col maybe cards.
- max-width 520: fine tune battle and nav.

Topbar mobile: height 62, padding 12, brand mark 36, brand text 16, small hidden maybe. Currency compact. Hide help? Keep. Wallet labels? It's numbers. On very narrow hide gem? no. Fit: brand 36+ text 95 + wallet 2*~58 + 2*34 = 315 + gaps 16+... maybe 390 fits tight. Hide sound? Keep both icon buttons 30 and help maybe hide help into? Could hide help on mobile? Accessibility via settings? Bottom nav no help. Keep help but shrink. Brand small hidden. Strong 16. Wallet 52 each (padding), icons 30. Total 36+8+90 + 8 + 104 + 6 + 60 = 312 + padding 24 = 336 fits 390. Good.

Bottom nav height 64 + safe. 5 items. Merge raised.

Home hero mobile:
- grid 1 col; padding 22; min-height 0.
- copy order 1, showcase order 2 with height 240.
- hero title 44.
- showcase art 220, ring 200.
- showcase card right 10 bottom 0; tag left.
- stat numbers.
- hero-ctas buttons flex 1.
- hero-meta maybe hidden one chip? fine.
- home stats 2x2.
- squad art 80.

Battle fit:
At 844 height:
- topbar 54; actions ~150; field 640. Enemy row ~130, center 54, player ~140 = 324; extra. Fine.
At mobile height 667: actions 140, top 54, field 473; rows 120 each + center 50 = 290 fits.
Set unit visual clamp(62px, 12vh, 130px). 3 units width 31%=120, art 120 but each 31% of 390=120 minus gaps; good.
- battle row gap 2px.
- unit meta font 8.
- enemy row align start.
- player art maybe slightly larger? Use same.
- actions buttons: with 3 columns, ability names long may truncate. Works.
- On 320 wide, icons + text maybe. Reduce icon 28, font 13.
- `action-btn` min-height 52.
- battle tip hide mobile.

Desktop battle:
- rows width; unit width min(30%,190). art height clamp up to 148. Good.
- battle field maybe max height. Actions centered.

Reward grid 2 cols mobile.
Modal detail:
- detail-layout 1 col; art-panel min-height 250 with art 190; border-right none border-bottom.
- body.

Merge:
- machine wraps? 4 elements widths at mobile: 92*3 + 26 + 30 + gaps 12 = 344 fits 390 with padding 36 => 354. Tight. At 320: slots 80 maybe via clamp: `width: clamp(72px, 22vw, 130px)`? Current clamp min 92; change responsive to 78. `merge-machine` gap 3. Arrow 24.
- merge actions stacked? Keep 2 buttons.

Campaign hero side: on mobile ch-side row with enemies and rec. Hide maybe. Make grid one col and side align start; show enemies.
- stage grid 1 col at <=760.
- `stage-card` 48+ content.

Nest hero 1 col centered; egg 130.
- egg grid 1 col <=760, maybe 2 at 600? Cards tall. One col good.
- daily.

Toast top 70.

CSS:
```
@media (max-width:1180px) {.main-nav{display:none}.bottom-nav{display:flex} .view-root{padding-bottom:...} ...}
```
Bottom nav needs flex child. Since app height dvh flex, bottom nav is child after main; main flex 1. Add `padding-bottom: calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))`. Height 64.
- `.bottom-link` active colors, center raised. Use `position:relative; flex:1; display:flex column`. Active color mint; `.bottom-link-main .bn-icon` circle.
- Add active bar.
- bottom nav background blur, border top.

Mobile main view padding bottom 20 (no need extra since bottom nav in flex).
Topbar sticky in flex no.

At <=1180 hide main nav and center top actions via margin-left auto. Brand.
Set toast top 80.

At max 900: hero grid 1 col? Maybe at <=980. Home hero showcase height 300, copy. Actually tablet 768 width can single. We'll set <=900 single hero, home-grid 1 col, merge 1 col, detail modal 1 col, monster grid 3, campaign hero 1fr? at 900.

At <=760: monster grid 2, stats 2, stage grid 1, egg grid 1, reward grid 2, view-head stack? title + action.
At <=520: topbar compact, headline 42, showcase, etc.

Battle mobile:
```
@media(max-width:720px){
 .battle-topbar{height:52px;padding:0 9px;gap:8}
 .b-stage-info b{font-size:15}
 .battle-field{padding:2px 4px 0}
 .battle-row{gap:1px}
 .unit-visual{height:clamp(64px,12vh,110px)}
 .unit-meta{padding:2px 6px;gap:3px}
 .unit-name{font-size:8px}
 .unit-lv{font-size:7px}
 .unit-hp{width:97%}
 .hp-text{font-size:6px}
 .battle-center{min-height:46px;gap:2px;padding:1px 6px}
 .turn-portrait{width:24;height:24;margin-left:-7}
